<% const rows=curriculum_rows(),stages=curriculum_stages(); %>
<div class="page-wrap curriculum-page" data-lab-catalog="courses" data-catalog-custom>
 <header class="curriculum-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">QUANTITATIVE RESEARCH / CURRICULUM</div><h1>量化研究系统课程</h1><p>从市场常识与 Python 开始，逐步学习数据、统计、策略、组合及交易执行。</p><div class="fl-actions"><a class="button" href="/read/?slug=<%= rows[0]?.slug||'quant-course-01' %>">开始第 1 课 →</a><a class="button secondary" href="#curriculum-sources">课程依据</a></div></div><aside><strong><%= rows.length %></strong><span>课程 · <%= stages.length %> 个阶段</span></aside></header>
 <section class="curriculum-sources" id="curriculum-sources" aria-label="课程依据"><article><span>学习路线</span><h2>量化研究学习路线图</h2><p>数学、编程与策略研究的学习顺序。</p></article><article><span>理论方法</span><h2>量化交易：算法、分析、数据、模型和优化</h2><p>统计模型、投资组合、订单簿与交易执行。</p></article><article><span>编程实践</span><h2>深入浅出 Python 量化交易实战</h2><p>回测、因子、机器学习与文本分析实例。</p></article></section>
 <div class="curriculum-toolbar"><label class="search-field"><%- icon('search') %><input id="curriculum-query" type="search" maxlength="100" placeholder="搜索课程、方法或主题" aria-label="搜索课程"></label><span id="curriculum-count" role="status"><%= rows.length %> 课</span></div>
 <div class="curriculum-toc"><strong>学习阶段</strong><nav id="curriculum-toc"><% stages.forEach(s=>{ %><a href="#stage-<%= String(s.id).padStart(2,'0') %>"><span><%= String(s.id).padStart(2,'0') %></span><%= s.name %></a><% }); %></nav><div class="curriculum-guide-links"><a class="text-link" href="/read/?slug=quant-course-66">知识与参考资料索引 →</a><a class="text-link" href="/assets/downloads/quant-curriculum-examples.zip">下载示例代码 ↓</a><span>登录后可记录进度、添加笔记和参与讨论。</span></div></div>
 <div id="curriculum-catalog"><%- curriculum_catalog() %></div><p id="curriculum-empty" class="muted" hidden>没有匹配的课程，请调整关键词。</p><p id="curriculum-sync" class="muted" role="status"></p>
 <noscript><p>课程目录可直接浏览，登录阅读和保存进度需要启用 JavaScript。</p></noscript>
</div>
